msgctxt "64"
msgid "Excuse me, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Who's asking?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "The name's Rick Langley, sir, with the CIA."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "I'm here with a message for you from Joji Kazama."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "A message, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "That's right, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"He said if you want to go back to Okinawa, you'll need to first take a taxi "
"to Yokoda Airfield, then hop on a jet down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Joji is on his way here as we speak. He will be seeing you\r\n"
"soon enough, I imagine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Right. Tell him I said thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Of course. Goodbye, sir."
msgstr ""

